    "termsOfAccess": "All data is available except for the audio files as they are sensitive data and we did not ask permission from the participants to have their speech audio files made available to the public. Thus, we only provided speech characteristics instead of raw speech audio data.\n\nAll scripts/materials are available, except for the stimuli material which require permissions from the authors because some of the Unity plugins are not free (thus, restricted access).",
